00:10.809 --> 00:12.853
This is Iori-chan! She's new here!

00:13.020 --> 00:16.148
She just started college this spring!

00:17.399 --> 00:21.278
Welcome! Thanks for requesting me today!

00:28.410 --> 00:29.995
It was just a dream...

00:30.955 --> 00:32.539
What a nightmare!

00:33.123 --> 00:35.793
I would never wear a high school girl's uniform.

00:36.752 --> 00:38.087
Good morning.

00:39.088 --> 00:40.547
Good morning.

00:42.091 --> 00:43.968
No!

00:44.969 --> 00:48.806
Be passionate, my friends

00:49.014 --> 00:52.059
Shine bright with the sun

00:52.226 --> 00:55.604
Dive into the blue sky

00:55.813 --> 00:59.900
And let summer take it all

01:02.903 --> 01:06.532
Grand Blue Dreaming

01:13.789 --> 01:17.626
Be passionate, my friends

01:17.793 --> 01:20.879
Shine bright with the sun

01:21.046 --> 01:24.174
Dive into the blue sky

01:24.383 --> 01:28.429
And let summer take it all

01:28.595 --> 01:31.432
An expanding ocean of possibilities

01:31.598 --> 01:35.477
Summer is our amore

01:35.644 --> 01:39.148
We'll swear to the crystal clear sky

01:39.315 --> 01:42.276
Summer is in our hands

01:42.443 --> 01:46.363
Be passionate, my friends

01:46.530 --> 01:49.533
Shine bright with the sun

01:49.700 --> 01:52.995
Dive into the blue sky

01:53.203 --> 01:56.623
And let summer take it all

01:56.790 --> 02:00.794
With a cheerful heart

02:00.961 --> 02:03.797
Don't mess with me

02:03.964 --> 02:07.259
Keep going even if you fall

02:07.468 --> 02:11.096
And let summer take it all

02:16.393 --> 02:20.439
I didn't know you guys were into that sort of thing...

02:20.606 --> 02:22.816
What are you talking about, Iori?

02:22.983 --> 02:24.777
That uniform...

02:24.943 --> 02:28.697
I like uniforms, but why did you give me
a boy's uniform?

02:29.198 --> 02:32.451
I thought we'd focus on our club activities today.

02:35.662 --> 02:37.331
Good morning. Huh?

02:37.498 --> 02:39.333
Uniforms...

02:40.042 --> 02:41.168
Perverts.

02:41.335 --> 02:44.588
- It's not what you think, Chisa!
- They told us they're for diving!

02:45.631 --> 02:47.841
Diving? Oh.

02:48.008 --> 02:49.635
So it's that time of year again...

02:49.802 --> 02:51.095
That's right.

02:52.179 --> 02:54.306
Chisa just accepted it...

02:54.473 --> 02:56.975
So, we really do need uniforms for diving?

02:57.810 --> 03:00.354
But how are we going to use these?

03:00.521 --> 03:02.481
Maybe they repel sharks.

03:02.648 --> 03:05.025
What are those two talking about?

03:05.192 --> 03:06.235
Who knows...

03:08.612 --> 03:10.489
Let me explain.

03:11.073 --> 03:13.075
This is the equipment we need for diving.

03:13.242 --> 03:14.493
WEIGHTS / SUIT / FINS, MASK, & SNORKEL
BCD / REGULATOR / DIVING COMPUTER, ETC.

03:14.743 --> 03:16.662
Then we don't need the uniforms!

03:16.829 --> 03:18.038
You lied to us!

03:18.205 --> 03:19.248
Be quiet and listen.

03:19.790 --> 03:21.750
In other words, diving...

03:21.917 --> 03:23.252
Is expensive.

03:23.669 --> 03:26.046
You understand what I'm trying to say, right?

03:27.089 --> 03:28.757
This is where those come in.

03:37.975 --> 03:40.936
Their imaginations are running wild.

03:42.479 --> 03:44.898
Have you guys heard of the Izu Spring Festival?

03:46.191 --> 03:48.902
It's our school festival, held in May.

03:49.445 --> 03:52.823
There's an event called the
"Inter-Club Men's Beauty Pageant."

03:52.990 --> 03:55.159
The winning club gets some prize money.

03:56.618 --> 04:00.038
I see. You want us to enter?

04:00.205 --> 04:01.665
- Correct!
- No!

04:02.207 --> 04:05.502
- Also called the male beauty pageant.
- Or, male pageant.

04:05.711 --> 04:06.962
That's terrible!

04:07.379 --> 04:08.755
Did you know about this?

04:08.922 --> 04:11.425
Well, yeah. I watched it last year.

04:11.842 --> 04:13.177
I'm not participating.

04:13.594 --> 04:17.097
Wearing an outfit like that and getting laughed at?
No way.

04:17.848 --> 04:19.183
Hey, Kohei.

04:20.809 --> 04:22.478
You're a pretty boy.

04:22.644 --> 04:23.645
What?!

04:23.812 --> 04:29.026
If you enter, you'd probably win.
Use your charm to help our club.

04:29.193 --> 04:30.444
I'm sorry, but...

04:30.819 --> 04:33.989
- So, you guys don't need me.
- Why not?

04:34.156 --> 04:36.200
You have Kohei.

04:36.450 --> 04:38.035
Hey, Iori.

04:38.202 --> 04:39.453
What?

04:40.370 --> 04:42.831
- You'll enter in the joke category.
- I'll kill you.

04:43.415 --> 04:46.335
- Put those on, you guys.
- Huh?

04:46.835 --> 04:48.587
We're going to the ocean today.

04:50.881 --> 04:52.132
How is the size?

04:52.299 --> 04:54.009
It's a little tight.

04:54.176 --> 04:56.345
As long as there're no gaps, it's fine.

04:56.762 --> 04:57.888
Let's go.

04:59.348 --> 05:00.390
Okay.

05:02.434 --> 05:03.477
The ocean...

05:05.270 --> 05:06.688
Aren't you going, Chisa?

05:06.855 --> 05:08.106
I'm watching the store.

05:08.482 --> 05:10.859
I see. Well, then...

05:11.944 --> 05:12.945
THE OCEAN, US, AND BLUE

05:13.111 --> 05:14.112
Hey, Iori.

05:16.114 --> 05:19.243
Were you excited when you started college life?

05:21.161 --> 05:22.746
- Huh?
- How did you feel?

05:24.456 --> 05:26.333
Now that you mention it, I did...

05:27.626 --> 05:28.835
feel excited...

05:30.295 --> 05:31.505
Then I'm sure

05:32.631 --> 05:34.258
you'll have fun.

05:37.010 --> 05:38.929
Iori will team up with me for practice.

05:39.096 --> 05:41.390
Then I'll practice with Kohei.

05:41.974 --> 05:43.725
This is really simple.

05:43.892 --> 05:46.395
You'll simulate what it's like
to breathe underwater.

05:47.187 --> 05:48.146
Okay...

05:48.522 --> 05:50.774
Put the regulator in your mouth and breathe in.

05:51.400 --> 05:52.401
Okay.

05:57.739 --> 05:58.740
How was it?

05:59.074 --> 06:02.369
It feels really different from breathing normally.

06:02.578 --> 06:05.914
Correct. It's as if the air flows in
all at once when you breathe in.

06:06.164 --> 06:07.666
That's true.

06:07.833 --> 06:10.627
You have to use force to breathe in.

06:10.794 --> 06:15.048
Yeah. You might have a hard time
breathing until you get used to it.

06:15.215 --> 06:18.176
- Okay.
- Let's try actually diving underwater.

06:19.845 --> 06:21.054
Okay...

06:30.230 --> 06:31.231
Iori...

06:38.113 --> 06:39.656
Hey, Iori.

06:39.823 --> 06:41.116
What?

06:41.283 --> 06:42.826
Why are you out of breath?

06:43.076 --> 06:44.494
Because I can't breathe.

06:44.661 --> 06:46.955
Then why are you carrying
that tank on your back?

06:47.497 --> 06:51.460
I'm scared of breathing underwater.

06:51.877 --> 06:53.503
- Scared?
- Yes.

06:53.670 --> 06:58.467
I see. Well, you might feel confused at first,
but you'll get used to it.

07:00.636 --> 07:02.638
Then I'll try it one more time.

07:11.772 --> 07:13.398
What's wrong? Are you okay?

07:13.565 --> 07:14.983
Water leaked into my mask...

07:15.150 --> 07:17.486
Maybe it's too loose. Let me see.

07:18.862 --> 07:20.322
Thank you very much!

07:21.365 --> 07:23.116
- Who are those customers?
- Wait up!

07:23.533 --> 07:26.370
Oh. They came to dive before their business trip.

07:26.620 --> 07:28.747
That looks rough.

07:28.914 --> 07:32.084
They look really busy,
but they even brought their suits.

07:32.959 --> 07:35.128
- It's reassuring, right?
- Reassuring?

07:35.379 --> 07:36.713
It's true, right?

07:36.880 --> 07:40.759
They're spending their
precious money and time on diving.

07:40.926 --> 07:41.927
In other words...

07:42.552 --> 07:46.223
it proves just how alluring this place is!

07:51.395 --> 07:53.647
You said it's scary underwater, right?

07:53.855 --> 07:56.274
- Sorry.
- You don't have to apologize.

07:56.983 --> 08:01.279
Even I get scared when I think about what would happen
if I run out of air.

08:01.697 --> 08:03.782
Do you know what this is?

08:04.032 --> 08:06.451
- Uh...
- This is called an octopus.

08:06.618 --> 08:08.412
It's a spare regulator.

08:08.578 --> 08:12.040
You give it to your buddy if they run out of air.

08:12.749 --> 08:15.043
And the weight belt always faces the same way.

08:15.210 --> 08:16.920
There's a reason for that too.

08:17.170 --> 08:20.132
It's so you can remove it quickly
if something happens.

08:20.841 --> 08:25.095
It's not only for your own safety.
It's so you can help the friends you dive with.

08:26.138 --> 08:28.265
We did a thorough safety check.

08:28.432 --> 08:30.767
You're not here alone. I'm here too.

08:31.393 --> 08:33.770
You'll be fine, so be tough and go dive.

08:34.104 --> 08:35.939
I'll help you, no matter what.

08:40.402 --> 08:41.445
All right!

08:42.946 --> 08:45.282
- Here I go!
- Yeah.

09:00.714 --> 09:02.507
Huh? I did it!?

09:02.674 --> 09:04.468
It's not tough at all!

09:04.634 --> 09:06.011
I did it!

09:12.434 --> 09:13.727
So this is...

09:14.311 --> 09:15.854
what it's like underwater.

09:18.231 --> 09:19.524
A new world...

09:20.108 --> 09:21.985
I didn't know about.

09:27.949 --> 09:29.367
- Chisa!
- Iori?

09:29.534 --> 09:31.912
I understand what you were trying to say now!

09:32.078 --> 09:34.706
It's amazing to be able to breathe underwater!

09:34.873 --> 09:37.501
- And I can't even swim!
- Oh, really...

09:37.667 --> 09:42.005
So, this is what it means to experience
a new world!

09:42.172 --> 09:46.384
So, this is how it feels to go to outer space
and experience zero gravity!

09:46.551 --> 09:49.262
- Iori, I know. Now go change...
- I wonder if it feels like

09:49.429 --> 09:52.641
- you're floating when you really get into diving...
- People

09:52.808 --> 09:55.852
who only choose what they know
will never experience that joy.

09:56.019 --> 09:57.229
What do you mean?

09:57.395 --> 10:00.774
- You don't understand?
- I'm talking about this, of course!

10:01.149 --> 10:04.319
It's the joy of learning how to do
something you couldn't do before.

10:05.445 --> 10:07.030
Cheers!

10:09.032 --> 10:11.159
- That was good!
- It burns.

10:11.618 --> 10:13.161
Have some food with your drinks.

10:14.621 --> 10:15.872
Thanks!

10:16.039 --> 10:17.666
That was great, Iori.

10:17.999 --> 10:19.376
You conquered your fear.

10:19.543 --> 10:21.169
I'm still not great in the water.

10:21.545 --> 10:25.173
But you learned how fun it is
to step into a new world!

10:26.132 --> 10:27.926
Yeah! Thank you.

10:28.718 --> 10:30.762
No, you don't have to thank us.

10:31.221 --> 10:32.931
Right. Now...

10:34.683 --> 10:38.436
There's no reason for you
to say no to this new world either!

10:38.687 --> 10:41.147
No!

10:45.026 --> 10:47.320
I drank too much again...

10:47.904 --> 10:49.030
Water...

10:49.990 --> 10:51.825
What are you doing?

10:57.664 --> 10:59.457
Let's stay in bed a bit longer.

11:05.505 --> 11:07.424
Huh? Uh... Huh?

11:11.761 --> 11:13.305
This can't be real.

11:13.471 --> 11:16.975
Getting drunk and waking up to
someone half-naked sleeping next to me...

11:18.727 --> 11:20.437
Is a normal thing now...

11:20.896 --> 11:23.857
I mean... Who is she?

11:24.024 --> 11:27.193
- Oh. This is the first time you guys met.
- Whoa!

11:27.360 --> 11:29.279
You know that our club
is an intercollegiate club, right?

11:29.446 --> 11:30.780
A CLUB WITH MEMBERS FROM DIFFERENT COLLEGES

11:30.947 --> 11:33.450
So, she's from another school?

11:33.617 --> 11:36.703
She's Azusa Hamaoka from Oumi Women's University.

11:36.870 --> 11:39.289
Why is she sleeping here?

11:39.456 --> 11:41.041
Maybe because there was a futon.

11:41.207 --> 11:44.210
I was sleeping in that futon first...

11:44.377 --> 11:46.838
She's not the type of girl to care about that.

11:48.965 --> 11:49.966
Whoa.

11:50.133 --> 11:53.595
Who would take off their clothes
and sleep in a room with naked guys?

11:53.929 --> 11:55.055
That's what I mean.

11:55.221 --> 11:58.266
If you treat her like a girl,
you'll make a fool out of yourself.

11:59.059 --> 12:01.186
You're wearing clothes? That's unusual.

12:01.353 --> 12:03.605
We have something to do outside today.

12:03.855 --> 12:05.815
That's why we invited Azusa.

12:05.982 --> 12:08.360
- Let's wake her up then.
- Wait.

12:09.235 --> 12:11.613
There's something we have to tell you first.

12:11.780 --> 12:14.449
Something important about the Izu Spring Festival.

12:21.081 --> 12:22.624
Okay, done!

12:24.334 --> 12:25.961
You're really good.

12:26.127 --> 12:27.379
Not really!

12:27.629 --> 12:30.090
We'll be selling okonomiyaki
at the Izu Spring Festival?

12:30.256 --> 12:32.717
- It's delicious!
- It has to be!

12:32.884 --> 12:35.387
The sales will go to fund our club.

12:35.637 --> 12:39.891
Today, we're going to have the freshmen
learn how to make these.

12:41.393 --> 12:42.936
What about you, Tokki and Bukki?

12:43.103 --> 12:46.523
- Oh, we're...
- Tokita! Kotobuki!

12:46.690 --> 12:48.900
- Let's go!
- Okay.

12:49.693 --> 12:51.319
We're going to prep the equipment.

12:51.486 --> 12:53.405
When we're done,
we'll eat with everyone.

12:53.571 --> 12:55.073
So, make a lot of them.

12:55.532 --> 12:56.700
Okay.

12:56.866 --> 12:59.285
- Then let's begin!
- Okay.

13:00.620 --> 13:02.038
Let's do it, Kohei!

13:02.288 --> 13:04.040
Leave it to me, Kitahara!

13:04.290 --> 13:06.501
Something about the Izu Spring Festival?

13:06.668 --> 13:08.253
It's not about the male pageant?

13:08.420 --> 13:10.630
Actually, it is related to that...

13:10.797 --> 13:13.425
We want you to convince Chisa.

13:13.842 --> 13:15.010
What do you mean?

13:15.176 --> 13:17.762
There's an Izu Spring Festival
women's beauty pageant.

13:17.929 --> 13:21.641
We want Chisa to enter so that
we can get more funds for our club.

13:21.808 --> 13:25.186
- You want us to convince her to enter!?
- That's impossible!

13:25.437 --> 13:28.148
But if she wins,

13:28.732 --> 13:31.526
you guys don't have to enter
the male pageant anymore.

13:32.193 --> 13:35.238
All right! Let's do it!

13:39.576 --> 13:43.163
Normally, Chisa would never agree
to enter the women's beauty pageant.

13:43.329 --> 13:47.042
Then we just have to put her
in an abnormal condition.

13:47.208 --> 13:49.169
We'll get her drunk, she'll loosen up,

13:49.335 --> 13:51.212
and we'll get her to enter the pageant!

13:51.755 --> 13:53.840
It's hot today, Kohei!

13:54.007 --> 13:55.216
Right, Kitahara!

13:55.383 --> 13:57.886
It's so hot I'm going to get heatstroke!

13:58.511 --> 14:00.555
We have to stay hydrated!

14:00.722 --> 14:03.099
I'll go bring something to drink!

14:04.142 --> 14:06.478
VODKA + WHISKEY
OOLONG TEA

14:06.728 --> 14:09.439
- Here's some oolong tea.
- Oh, thanks.

14:09.606 --> 14:12.400
Kitahara, got it?
The alcohol is in my right hand.

14:12.567 --> 14:15.028
The right hand is for Chisa.
The left hand is for me.

14:16.071 --> 14:17.739
Hey, Chisa. Have a drink.

14:17.906 --> 14:19.991
I can't stop right now.
I'll have some later.

14:20.575 --> 14:22.577
Then I'll take it.

14:22.744 --> 14:23.870
Huh?

14:24.037 --> 14:25.872
VODKA + WHISKEY

14:27.165 --> 14:30.627
- Aren't you going to drink?
- Well...

14:30.794 --> 14:33.797
What? Is there something weird in it?

14:35.757 --> 14:38.301
Of course not!
Come on, drink up, Kitahara!

14:38.468 --> 14:40.762
Yeah! You're right!

14:42.388 --> 14:43.765
What's wrong, Iori?

14:43.932 --> 14:45.642
Oh, nothing.

14:45.892 --> 14:47.685
You bastard! Look what you did!

14:47.852 --> 14:49.646
It was unavoidable!

14:50.271 --> 14:51.272
Let's switch!

14:51.523 --> 14:53.358
I'll do it this time.

14:53.525 --> 14:55.902
I'll bring some drinks!

14:58.071 --> 14:59.656
What are you making?

15:01.574 --> 15:03.493
Chisa!? This isn't--

15:03.660 --> 15:06.162
You guys sure are pathetic.

15:06.913 --> 15:10.250
You're trying to get Imamura to drink that, right?

15:14.712 --> 15:15.922
Kohei. Here's some tea.

15:16.089 --> 15:17.841
Oh. Thanks.

15:21.553 --> 15:23.304
Sorry. It was unavoidable.

15:23.471 --> 15:26.933
How was this unavoidable!?

15:31.229 --> 15:32.564
Good job!

15:32.730 --> 15:34.899
I'm not as good as you, though.

15:35.066 --> 15:36.234
It's okay!

15:36.609 --> 15:38.444
It's just for the school festival.

15:42.198 --> 15:45.827
In a setting like this...

15:45.994 --> 15:47.162
What?

15:47.328 --> 15:50.957
- Don't you feel like having a beer?
- I knew you'd say that! So I brought some!

15:51.124 --> 15:52.667
I don't want any.

15:54.002 --> 15:55.587
Can I have some?

15:58.506 --> 16:00.341
You two are really considerate!

16:00.508 --> 16:01.509
Well, well...

16:01.676 --> 16:03.845
We're extremely delighted.

16:05.430 --> 16:08.349
Just like I heard from Nanaka. You're cute.

16:08.516 --> 16:11.186
- From Nanaka?
- Are you guys close?

16:11.352 --> 16:13.354
We talk on the phone sometimes.

16:13.980 --> 16:16.441
That's why I know a lot about you,

16:16.608 --> 16:18.776
- Iori.
- Oh.

16:18.943 --> 16:20.987
She told me lots of things.

16:21.362 --> 16:22.989
Nanaka...

16:25.241 --> 16:27.243
I have to go call my friend...

16:30.079 --> 16:31.956
Iori. That's disgusting.

16:32.123 --> 16:34.042
What are you doing?

16:35.126 --> 16:38.463
That porn and that gay porn...
It's all a misunderstanding!

16:38.630 --> 16:40.089
It's okay!

16:40.256 --> 16:42.675
No, it's not okay...

16:43.676 --> 16:45.220
Actually,

16:45.386 --> 16:47.222
I'm okay with both too.

16:51.476 --> 16:54.562
It's nice to meet someone who's into the same stuff!

16:54.729 --> 16:56.814
Let's talk someday, okay?

16:57.148 --> 16:59.901
- Into the same stuff?
- She's talking about diving, right?

17:01.152 --> 17:02.278
Hey, Kitahara!

17:02.737 --> 17:04.906
There's no time for meaningless conversation!

17:05.073 --> 17:07.534
This is pretty important...

17:09.827 --> 17:11.037
Is something wrong?

17:11.204 --> 17:14.165
- No! Nothing!
- I'm going to get some drinks!

17:16.459 --> 17:18.586
I didn't want it to come down to this...

17:19.128 --> 17:21.547
I'll have to give everyone this...

17:23.591 --> 17:25.635
- Here's some oolong tea!
- Here!

17:25.802 --> 17:28.304
- I still have some. I'm fine.
- Me too.

17:29.722 --> 17:30.807
There's more!

17:34.143 --> 17:35.770
Shaved ice is perfect for the sea!

17:35.937 --> 17:37.438
It has special syrup!

17:37.605 --> 17:39.107
I'm full.

17:39.274 --> 17:40.942
You guys can have it.

17:43.319 --> 17:45.571
What are you guys doing?

17:45.863 --> 17:47.907
Can I ask you something?

17:48.241 --> 17:50.410
Why are you trying to get Chii-chan drunk?

17:50.994 --> 17:52.537
What you're talking about!?

17:52.704 --> 17:54.831
That's a pretty extreme accusation!

17:54.998 --> 17:58.960
If you're trying to get her drunk, then I have an idea.

17:59.127 --> 18:00.795
No! That's not what we're doing!

18:00.962 --> 18:03.089
Then what were you trying to do?

18:03.256 --> 18:05.717
It can't be helped!

18:05.883 --> 18:07.719
No more tricks! Chisa!

18:08.720 --> 18:09.721
What?

18:09.887 --> 18:12.140
- Enter the women's beauty pageant!
- No.

18:12.557 --> 18:14.767
He'll kneel down naked and beg you! Please!

18:14.934 --> 18:16.311
Want me to step on him?

18:16.477 --> 18:18.229
Just answer yes or no!

18:18.396 --> 18:20.189
- Please!
- We're begging you!

18:20.356 --> 18:21.983
I said no!

18:22.442 --> 18:25.695
That won't work. If you're going
to ask her for something,

18:25.862 --> 18:27.989
you should tell her your reason.

18:30.199 --> 18:31.367
You don't have a reason?

18:31.534 --> 18:32.827
Well...

18:32.994 --> 18:36.497
If Chisa enters, we can get the prize money.

18:36.664 --> 18:40.126
Then we don't have to enter
the male pageant.

18:41.669 --> 18:44.005
I see. Now I understand.

18:44.172 --> 18:45.381
What about it, Chii-chan?

18:46.299 --> 18:47.717
No way.

18:49.218 --> 18:50.720
I was expecting this...

18:50.887 --> 18:53.014
You shouldn't have asked in the first place.

18:53.473 --> 18:55.266
What? She said no?

18:55.642 --> 18:57.602
We didn't even have a chance.

18:57.769 --> 19:00.521
So, now we have to enter the male pageant...

19:00.688 --> 19:02.273
It can't be helped.

19:02.565 --> 19:05.610
Who entered the pageant when it was your turn?

19:05.777 --> 19:07.528
Azusa entered the women's pageant.

19:07.945 --> 19:09.447
She is pretty.

19:09.614 --> 19:12.533
- She lost in the preliminaries though.
- Huh? Why?

19:12.700 --> 19:15.912
She forgot her swimsuit and competed in her underwear,
so she was disqualified.

19:16.079 --> 19:17.914
That's amazing.

19:18.164 --> 19:19.749
She wasn't embarrassed?

19:19.916 --> 19:21.334
She's that type of girl.

19:21.501 --> 19:22.668
No, that can't...

19:23.044 --> 19:25.630
Well, you'll find out soon.

19:26.172 --> 19:28.549
Take it off!

19:28.841 --> 19:31.177
If you lose, you have to spread your legs!

19:34.305 --> 19:37.100
All right! I'm going to go join them.

19:37.392 --> 19:38.559
Go ahead.

19:38.726 --> 19:40.937
Azusa likes that kind of stuff.

19:41.187 --> 19:43.022
Let me join!

19:43.189 --> 19:45.233
Okay! Huh!?

19:45.900 --> 19:47.318
- Really?
- Yeah.

19:47.485 --> 19:49.862
It's naked rock paper scissors!
You'll strip?

19:50.029 --> 19:51.197
Are you okay with that?

19:51.406 --> 19:53.699
If you lose, you strip!
It's naked rock paper scissors!

19:53.950 --> 19:56.119
I'm not going to get totally naked though.

19:56.285 --> 19:58.204
I'm a young girl, you know.

19:58.371 --> 20:01.207
- Oh, yeah.
- You're right.

20:01.582 --> 20:02.709
That's why...

20:03.042 --> 20:04.419
I've stuck band-aids on.

20:06.421 --> 20:07.630
I'll go first.

20:07.797 --> 20:09.215
But, Kitahara...

20:09.465 --> 20:11.134
You have nothing left to take off.

20:12.385 --> 20:14.262
There's nothing to worry about, Kohei.

20:14.429 --> 20:15.430
Just once.

20:15.596 --> 20:18.433
I'm going to bet everything on just one chance.

20:19.434 --> 20:20.017
HAIRPIN

20:21.394 --> 20:24.230
Tokki! Bukki! This guy is great!

20:24.397 --> 20:25.898
I'm glad you like him.

20:26.065 --> 20:27.233
He's talented, right?

20:27.650 --> 20:29.360
Let's compete on speed!

20:29.527 --> 20:32.280
I'm going to take this one standing.
You stay back, Kohei.

20:32.447 --> 20:34.365
No, you stay back.

20:37.243 --> 20:39.078
That was fun!

20:39.579 --> 20:41.831
- They're nice, right?
- Yeah.

20:42.206 --> 20:44.333
What's nice about them?

20:45.001 --> 20:46.836
I like them, though.

20:48.838 --> 20:50.840
- Hey, Chii-chan.
- Yes?

20:51.007 --> 20:53.259
Why don't you enter the women's beauty pageant?

20:54.343 --> 20:55.344
No.

20:55.511 --> 20:59.098
- It's part of the joy of being born a woman.
- What do you mean?

21:00.391 --> 21:01.976
You know...

21:02.143 --> 21:05.980
Those guys never doubted
that you'd win, right?

21:06.522 --> 21:10.234
It's because they think
you're the cutest one, Chii-chan.

21:11.402 --> 21:15.239
If Chisa enters, we can get the prize money.

21:17.992 --> 21:18.993
What do you think?

21:19.994 --> 21:21.454
- Well...
- Huh?

21:21.621 --> 21:24.916
It's not that I won't do it no matter what...

21:28.461 --> 21:33.508
I just don't like how
they're trying to embarrass only me.

21:35.676 --> 21:37.220
HEARTTHROB
LEMON SOUR

21:37.386 --> 21:39.972
- What?
- You're right.

21:40.139 --> 21:42.266
That's not very manly.

21:42.767 --> 21:44.560
Then let's do this.

21:48.189 --> 21:49.941
Thanks to Iori and Kohei,

21:50.107 --> 21:52.568
Chisa decided to enter the women's beauty pageant.

21:53.444 --> 21:56.239
- Really?
- She changed her mind overnight?

21:56.447 --> 21:58.533
So, there's something we want to give you.

21:59.367 --> 22:01.035
Here. Take this.

22:02.703 --> 22:03.913
Why?!

22:04.163 --> 22:07.667
Chisa said she'd enter the women's beauty pageant
under one condition.

22:07.833 --> 22:09.835
You guys have to enter the male pageant.

22:10.002 --> 22:11.754
Then why did we even...

22:11.921 --> 22:13.422
It was all for nothing!

22:13.673 --> 22:17.677
- You wear the girl's uniform!
- You're the one entering the joke category!

22:18.302 --> 22:20.137
They look like they're having fun.

22:20.304 --> 22:21.931
I'm glad they're close.

22:22.306 --> 22:25.184
- Everything's okay now, right?
- Yes.

22:27.270 --> 22:29.855
Well, I feel a little better now.

22:32.400 --> 22:33.401
DEEP BLUE AL FINE
KAYA MIZUKI

22:33.609 --> 22:35.695
Here's your mic, Kitahara.

22:35.903 --> 22:39.949
Me, too...? All right, let's do this!

22:40.116 --> 22:43.452
- Yeah, sing your heart out.
- You guys seem to be having fun.

22:45.121 --> 22:51.127
A fairytale whispers
In a fake world

22:51.294 --> 22:57.049
Hiding in the complete darkness

22:57.216 --> 23:03.014
I reach for the forbidden fruit
In my last days

23:03.180 --> 23:09.312
Now I know the meaning of the song about hope

23:09.478 --> 23:14.567
A broken gear will never stop again

23:14.734 --> 23:22.158
Even if I were to lose everything
I'd still want you to know

23:22.325 --> 23:28.247
Trapped in the sky so far away
I'm praying with ripped off wings

23:28.456 --> 23:34.211
Because we span together
The vows of areppegio

23:34.378 --> 23:40.134
If life sparkles only to the beat
of the resonating stars

23:40.301 --> 23:43.137
I'll sacrifice everything

23:43.304 --> 23:47.683
Till death do us apart

23:47.892 --> 23:49.769
Cheers!

23:54.565 --> 23:57.193
We're very sorry!

24:02.323 --> 24:05.117
Izu Spring Festival! Yay!

24:05.284 --> 24:06.911
I'm Chisa Kotegawa
from Peek-a-Boo!

24:07.078 --> 24:09.080
Take this!

24:13.918 --> 24:14.919
A ghost!

24:15.086 --> 24:16.879
NEXT EPISODE
"THE MALE BEAUTY PAGEANT"
